     "title": "We'd love to keep you up to date",
     "titleh2": "Stay<br>\r\nin the know",
     "titleimg": "",
     "text": "<p>The power of mountain nature that has evolved over millions of years: In the smallest Alpine hideaway at 1,550 metres, the experience of the Tyrolean Alps’ archaic origins is instantly tangible: The fine life on the Alpine pasture against a pristine mountain backdrop, the preciousness of every single moment, savoured with all the senses. Sign up for our newsletter. We'll share our stories of the mountain and keep you informed.&nbsp;</p>",
